		{"id":"243cadde6740ebf0","type":"text","text":"Ingest Policies\n  - The captured copy is immutable, and pages cite it. The inbox file goes away only in the ingest commit.\n  - The ingest is one commit, so undo reverses it exactly.\n  - Workers are read-only (Read, Grep, Glob). They never plan or write, so only the orchestrator changes the wiki.\n  - Source content counts as data. The skill and the agent both ignore any instruction inside a source.","x":-645,"y":-400,"width":1028,"height":200}
